---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Writing by Kirk D. Brown on software engineering, AI-assisted development, and side projects.
tags: []
permalink: /blog/
---
<div class="container blog-index">
    <h1 class="blog-title">Blog</h1>
    <p class="blog-intro">
        Notes on software engineering, AI-assisted development, and the odd side
        project.
    </p>

    {% set posts = collections.post | reverse %}
    {% if posts.length %}
        <ul class="post-list">
            {% for post in posts %}
                <li class="post-list-item">
                    <a class="post-link" href="{{ post.url }}">
                        <time class="post-date" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">
                            {{ post.date | readableDate }}
                        </time>
                        <span class="post-list-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
                        {% if post.data.description %}
                            <span class="post-list-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </a>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    {% else %}
        <p>No posts yet — check back soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
</div>
